	"data": "Awake\n\nStage 3 — Seye, after the protection fails\n\nThe first thing Seye noticed was that the fog had stopped being visual.\n\nIt had been visual for hours. Swirls of gray that pretended to be corridors, walls that looked like water, water that looked like nothing at all. The protection spells had held against that — barely, cracking at the edges like old paint, but held. Seye had watched the illusions bounce off the barrier the way light bounces off glass: present, recognized, kept outside.\n\nWhen…",
